iTerm2 is GPL-2.0 without "or later", so the files ported from it are
GPL-2.0-only, crediting George Nachman and the iTerm2 authors: the
status model and program status records with their tests, the OSC 21337
parser, the Diff member's waiting message and the code review prompts.
The plugin's README lists them.

